<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 17 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 17 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.0671 trillion in the week to October 17 from $1.0733 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     58.66		51.88</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     27.28		26.63</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1008.45	    1021.42</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    179.44	     210.04</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	755.03	     750.04</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    312.08	     323.26</p>
</text>
